---
description: Decide which actual search hits merit typed live descriptions for this user goal.
args:
  goal: string
  hits: DocHit[]
returns: string[]
---
Choose at most six exact observed IDs. Prefer concrete methods that cover each permitted step. A similar service parent or unrelated version is not a substitute for an exact relevant method. For an inventory request surface counts are separate from the representative method descriptions. Do not invent an ID when a search hit was absent.
